          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "A detailed overview and codebook of all variables included in this dataset are available in the NIDIO manual (see <a href=\"https://osf.io/9b2xh/\" target=\"_blank\"> osf.io/9b2xh/</a>). The NIDIO manual also lists the original source variable from which each variable in the dataset is derived. The NIDIO variable descriptions and labels are in English. The dataset includes 28 variables and broadly covers the following content of SPOLIS:\n<ul>\n  <li>Various identifiers (year; rinpersoon; beid; baanrugid; ikvid; slbaanid) </li>\n  <li>Job characteristics (e.g., cao status; contract type; ft factor; overall starting date of job; …)</li>\n  <li>Total compensation in year XXXX (decomposable into various components)</li>\n  <li>Total working hours in year XXXX</li>\n</ul>\nThe combination of the variables year, rinpersoon and baanrugid / ikvid is the unique identifier of each observation"
          },
